## PRD: Server Action Integration

### What Is
Basket page has no server action to fetch product data from CMS based on basket product IDs.

### What Should Be
Server action fetches product data from CMS and refreshes zustand store with stock validation, removing zero-stock items and capping quantities.

### Definition of Done

[ ] Create server action to fetch basket products
[ ] Remove items with stock === 0 from store
[ ] Cap quantity at available stock
[ ] Render basket page from refreshed store
[ ] Integration test: server action updates store correctly
[ ] Integration test: zero-stock items removed

### Verification

```bash
npm run build
npm run test:integration
```
